The commit message does not mention three things the diff does: it changes
the TSM report path to allocate a full `TDX_QUOTE_MAX_LEN` (~128 KiB) buffer
for every report instead of an exact-size copy; it adds MAINTAINERS F: lines;
and it adds a duplicated set of length constants. Also "Tie clients to
service initialization and removal" is misleading, see the exit-path comment.

> in-kernel client while preserving the existing misc, TSM report and TSM
> MR interfaces. Tie clients to service initialization and removal.
