If attach fails (`add()` returns an error) the failure is returned to the
registering client, good, but when registration happens before the service
is ready, `add()` is deferred to `tdx_guest_init()`, where a failing `add()` fails
the whole `tdx_guest` module init (see below). The same client therefore gets
